<title>FRANCE: Majority of French back France Telecom share sale.</title>
<headline>Majority of French back France Telecom share sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A majority of the French people favour the public sale of shares in state-owned telecommunications firm France Telecom, said a BVA opinion poll to be published on Thursday in the weekly Paris Match.</p>
<p>The poll found that 68 percent backed either a total or partial privatisation of France Telecom SA, compared to 27 percent who opposed its sale and five percent who expressed no opinion.</p>
<p>A total of 67 percent favoured the partial or total privatisation of banking giant Credit Lyonnais, 70 percent national airline Air France and 59 percent aircraft maker Aerospatiale, the poll found.</p>
<p>BVA based its findings on surveys of 941 individuals conducted last Friday and Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
